# DESK15 probe: boot, park the pointer bottom-right, open the C: window with a
# double-click on the drive icon.  `desk15_dump` runs after every window
# repaint (method/desk15_patch.py), so the serial log carries the item click
# points of the open window.
#   Drive-C icon click point (38,35) from the desktop-up dump.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1500 mark P_IDLE
1800 move 38 35
2100 down
2103 up
2108 down
2111 up
2600 move 600 460
3400 mark P_WIN
